i-am-the-clone-of-a-death-row-inmate:
A thousand years ago, a Rain of Evolution fell, and the world entered the Era of Evolution.
Animals, plants, and humans all gained the potential to evolve into higher-level life forms.
However, the human method of evolution is unique; they must absorb the extracts of higher-level life forms to complete their evolution, and each time they absorb an extract, they also acquire a skill from the extract's original owner.
Absorb the extract of an “Undying Salamander” and gain the ability of limb regeneration;
Absorb the extract of an “Iron Armor Oyster” and possess a flexible gender;
Absorb the extract of a “Forest Giant Cockroach” and transform into an unkillable cockroach;
Su Ze has come to this world, but before he can begin his evolution, he must solve his life-and-death crisis.
“My name is Su Ze.”
“I originally thought I had transmigrated and become a scion of a powerful official, but I never expected that I was just his clone, a scapegoat for him to escape punishment, a tool used for him to fake his death and get away.”
“What's worse is, I'm scheduled to be executed tomorrow, but my cheat has not yet arrived...”
